        # RELOCATION sections (a BOLT artifact), so any consumer that EMBEDS
        # libpython and takes the address of PyExc_*/Py*_Type got a zero-filled
        # .bss slot and segfaulted in Py_InitializeFromConfig -- `openroad
        # -python`, i.e. every LibreLane flow above stage 15. The interpreter
        # itself is unaffected, which is why a `python3.14 -c pass` smoke cannot
